# demo — a tiny example pack that proves the `iictl pack` round-trip end to end
# (PROPOSAL §4 Pillar 1). The real packs (gaming, lang-*, virt, security…) land
# in #19/#25; this is the minimal example the maintainer installs and removes to
# verify the engine. All members are small, official-repo CLIs and are NEVER
# baked into the image — `iictl pack install demo` fetches them online on demand,
# `iictl pack remove demo` does an exact `pacman -Rns` of the recorded set.
#meta:type example
sl
cowsay
